  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power Sector Reform Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi - Power Sector Reform Project: This project will create an enabling environment for future expansion of the power sector by strengthening sector institutions and enhancing regulation and governance of the sector by rebuilding ESCOM into a financially strong, well-managed utility and developing a regulatory environment that supports public and private investment in generation capacity and expanded access.</narrative>
  </description>
